WEBVTT

00:00:01.717 --> 00:00:04.261
Do you all know who Catia's Angels are?

00:00:04.345 --> 00:00:06.430
Yes, I'm talking about the two beautiful girls

00:00:06.514 --> 00:00:08.599
who work as security police
for the Catian Embassy.

00:00:08.682 --> 00:00:11.018
They were once agents
who were above the law,

00:00:11.101 --> 00:00:13.521
but Eris became fond of them,
and took them away from all that.

00:00:13.604 --> 00:00:15.940
We would very much
like for you to watch and see

00:00:16.023 --> 00:00:19.985
where their adventures take them.

00:00:27.660 --> 00:00:29.411
I'm still inexperienced

00:00:29.495 --> 00:00:35.209
There are many answers before my eyes

00:00:35.292 --> 00:00:42.424
How many equal parts
can you divide one sky into?

00:00:42.508 --> 00:00:44.301
Give me them all,
because they're so much fun

00:00:44.385 --> 00:00:46.053
I want them all to myself

00:00:46.136 --> 00:00:49.515
My true colors spill into the blue sky

00:00:49.598 --> 00:00:57.231
Man! I'll write your
name down so I don't lose it

00:00:57.314 --> 00:00:59.024
Why don't you get serious?

00:00:59.108 --> 00:01:04.238
I won't let you tell me you don't like to

00:01:04.321 --> 00:01:10.995
A pure love device (Set up now) and start it up

00:01:11.078 --> 00:01:15.082
On a runway of impatience and dreams

00:01:15.165 --> 00:01:18.961
fasten your seatbelt even tighter

00:01:19.044 --> 00:01:25.843
A cutting-edge device
(Back up now) it's starting up

00:01:25.926 --> 00:01:29.888
I want the original

00:01:29.972 --> 00:01:33.601
of your heart, at least,

00:01:33.684 --> 00:01:37.605
and I've put together a plan

00:01:42.026 --> 00:01:45.821
"Cat Planet Cuties"

00:01:56.707 --> 00:01:58.083
Aboard the Catia Ship,

00:01:58.167 --> 00:02:01.086
they were analyzing the
battle against the Androala.

00:02:01.962 --> 00:02:06.383
This is Futaba Aoi's gear,
the hard-soft powered suit.

00:02:06.467 --> 00:02:07.635
Thanks to it's demiflow metal,

00:02:07.718 --> 00:02:10.304
which changes shape
based on bio-electrical current,

00:02:10.387 --> 00:02:16.685
this powered-up exoskeleton
affords firm, powerful protection.

00:02:18.812 --> 00:02:22.858
Oh, that's really what you'd
call tough-as-nails hardness, isn't it?

00:02:25.986 --> 00:02:27.946
Oh, my, it went limp.

00:02:30.574 --> 00:02:34.495
These images from the
battle were still in its memory.

00:02:34.578 --> 00:02:36.664
Dogishua!

00:02:36.747 --> 00:02:40.292
It is now clear that the dogs
are already in contact with Earth,

00:02:40.376 --> 00:02:43.420
and are already in
hiding among them, huh?

00:02:43.504 --> 00:02:47.966
And since this happened in Japan,
it means they've already...

00:02:48.050 --> 00:02:51.095
No, this amounts to nothing
more than a technological license

00:02:51.178 --> 00:02:53.138
shared between two states.

00:02:53.222 --> 00:02:57.393
Ever since the great
lockdown by the Orzonians,

00:02:57.476 --> 00:03:02.690
they are not allowed to openly
begin any new diplomatic relations.

00:03:02.773 --> 00:03:07.444
They are probably using their technology
as a lure for some backroom negotiations.

00:03:07.528 --> 00:03:09.988
That is a problem.
They're going to try to block us

00:03:10.072 --> 00:03:13.492
from establishing diplomatic relations.

00:03:13.575 --> 00:03:17.413
Chayka, tell Eris to be on her guard.

00:03:17.496 --> 00:03:18.872
Roger!

00:03:20.082 --> 00:03:24.586
By the way, Chayka,
what kind of room is this?

00:03:24.670 --> 00:03:27.631
It's an Earth steam bath, called a "sauna."

00:03:27.715 --> 00:03:32.469
How can they stay in a
hot room like this? I can't bear it.

00:03:32.553 --> 00:03:33.804
Captain...

00:03:33.887 --> 00:03:37.808
| can't take it anymore, either.

00:03:37.891 --> 00:03:38.976
Are you all right?

00:03:39.059 --> 00:03:41.687
Oh, well. I guess we've had enough.

00:03:41.770 --> 00:03:44.732
Virtual Reality Program
to the next menu selection.

00:03:44.815 --> 00:03:46.900
Next menu selection?

00:03:48.944 --> 00:03:52.156
In a genuine Finnish sauna,
after one has warmed up,

00:03:52.239 --> 00:03:54.700
one cools down in the snow.

00:04:01.373 --> 00:04:03.542
Filming with the Video Club?

00:04:03.625 --> 00:04:06.336
Mm-hmm. Our club wants
to shoot a self-produced movie

00:04:06.420 --> 00:04:08.881
which has aliens in it.

00:04:08.964 --> 00:04:11.925
They said they wanted
you to appear in it, too, Eris.

00:04:12.009 --> 00:04:16.054
In that case, I'd be glad to help.

00:04:16.138 --> 00:04:17.848
Thank you, Eris.

00:04:17.931 --> 00:04:21.393
Let's see, what else should I take...?

00:04:21.477 --> 00:04:25.814
Ah, there's the tripod. Thanks, Sada-yan.

00:04:25.898 --> 00:04:29.610
How is your own personal
Assistroid working out, Kio?

00:04:29.693 --> 00:04:33.071
He's extremely helpful,
and quite attentive.

00:04:33.197 --> 00:04:34.907
"Thanks a bunch"

00:04:36.116 --> 00:04:38.494
Now then, the camera is okay,

00:04:38.577 --> 00:04:42.498
the battery is fully charged,
and I've got tapes to record over...

00:04:42.581 --> 00:04:45.959
No, today, I think I'll
open up a virgin tape.

00:04:47.252 --> 00:04:49.630
The tape... the tape...

00:04:49.713 --> 00:04:51.131
There it is.

00:04:51.215 --> 00:04:52.591
Kio...

00:04:53.842 --> 00:04:58.263
Today, would you
please open up my virgin tape?

00:04:59.181 --> 00:05:01.099
Ah, Eris!
What's suddenly come over you?!

00:05:01.183 --> 00:05:03.519
Oh, meow, Kio...

00:05:03.602 --> 00:05:05.229
--...let's breed!

00:05:05.229 --> 00:05:06.897
--Breed? You mean, you're in heat?
--...let's breed!

00:05:06.897 --> 00:05:08.482
--Breed? You mean, you're in heat?
--Kio!

00:05:11.109 --> 00:05:11.777
Huh?

00:05:11.819 --> 00:05:13.445
It came from the backyard!

00:05:14.321 --> 00:05:16.448
When you're reloading,

00:05:16.532 --> 00:05:17.866
while cradling it in your left hand,

00:05:17.950 --> 00:05:21.870
push the cylinder out with
your middle and ring fingers.

00:05:21.954 --> 00:05:24.748
Then, continue by pushing
the ejector rod with your index finger,

00:05:24.832 --> 00:05:28.335
and while emptying the cartridges,
ready the new rounds in your right hand.

00:05:28.418 --> 00:05:32.840
Turn the cylinder with your fingers
while loading two rounds at once.

00:05:32.923 --> 00:05:35.425
Close the cylinder with your thumb,

00:05:35.509 --> 00:05:38.762
while replacing your grip in your right
hand, and returning to a firing stance.

00:05:38.846 --> 00:05:40.722
You don't use a speed loader?

00:05:40.806 --> 00:05:42.057
They bulge in your pocket,

00:05:42.140 --> 00:05:44.268
revealing how many bullets you have left.

00:05:44.351 --> 00:05:45.435
Is that right?

00:05:45.519 --> 00:05:46.895
Watch.

00:05:56.905 --> 00:05:58.407
Amazing!

00:05:58.490 --> 00:06:00.492
Do you think I can do that, too?

00:06:00.576 --> 00:06:03.370
You just have to work at it. Practice.

00:06:03.453 --> 00:06:04.913
No! No! No!

00:06:04.997 --> 00:06:06.123
K-Kakazu!

00:06:06.206 --> 00:06:07.791
What are you two doing?!

00:06:07.875 --> 00:06:09.042
What are we doing?

00:06:09.126 --> 00:06:10.794
Pistol training.

00:06:10.878 --> 00:06:12.963
You're going to scare everyone
else in the neighborhood!

00:06:13.046 --> 00:06:14.423
I-I'm sorry, Kakazu.

00:06:14.506 --> 00:06:18.552
What is this?
This is part of our job, you know!

00:06:18.635 --> 00:06:21.263
As the Catian Embassy's security police,

00:06:21.346 --> 00:06:23.265
we've got to be able to train daily,

00:06:23.348 --> 00:06:25.100
or we'll be up the
creek if the time ever comes.

00:06:25.183 --> 00:06:27.978
| still have little practical experience at this.

00:06:28.061 --> 00:06:31.064
That's why I'm having a pro
like Aoi teaching me, you know?

00:06:31.148 --> 00:06:34.943
Sure enough, Manami,
you're making more unreasonable demands.

00:06:35.027 --> 00:06:36.695
Sorry about this, Futaba.

00:06:36.778 --> 00:06:39.823
Oh, no. That's okay.

00:06:39.907 --> 00:06:42.409
How did I become the bad guy?!

00:06:42.492 --> 00:06:46.121
This is Japan, and you can't
go shooting guns in your yard here.

00:06:46.204 --> 00:06:49.082
Look here! This is Catia's
provisional embassy,

00:06:49.166 --> 00:06:50.459
so it has extraterritorial jurisdiction,

00:06:50.542 --> 00:06:52.920
and diplomatic immunity, so it's all right!

00:06:53.003 --> 00:06:57.090
Manami, you're just a gun
nut who wants to shoot, right?

00:06:57.174 --> 00:06:59.968
Whatever the case, stop shooting.
You're scaring the neighbors.

00:07:00.052 --> 00:07:02.471
It wasn't that long ago that you
were shooting up the place naked.

00:07:02.554 --> 00:07:04.723
That was a huge mess afterward, right?

00:07:05.849 --> 00:07:08.226
Kio, you idiot!

00:07:11.980 --> 00:07:15.275
It looks like they
need a proper practice area.

00:07:15.984 --> 00:07:17.486
"That's the truth"

00:07:17.945 --> 00:07:21.740
That little dust-up cost us
twelve Assistroids,

00:07:21.823 --> 00:07:25.577
while they only lost one luxury liner.

00:07:25.661 --> 00:07:28.330
We came out on the
losing end of that battle.

00:07:29.873 --> 00:07:31.708
It appears that the
cats and the kitty-ear order

00:07:31.792 --> 00:07:33.794
have formed an alliance.

00:07:33.877 --> 00:07:35.879
They have attached
themselves to an organization

00:07:35.963 --> 00:07:38.590
with tremendous economic resources,
and ended up gaining power.

00:07:38.674 --> 00:07:40.717
Are you saying that I made a blunder?

00:07:40.801 --> 00:07:42.803
No, not at all.

00:07:42.886 --> 00:07:46.807
Indeed I did mess up.
However, it does not end here.

00:07:46.890 --> 00:07:49.810
| will drive them off of this world.

00:07:49.893 --> 00:07:56.149
Slowly, but surely.
| won't let my soldiers die like dogs.

00:07:59.611 --> 00:08:02.114
Anyways, if you're
trying to be attractive to boys,

00:08:02.197 --> 00:08:05.200
nothing beats a home-cooked lunch.

00:08:05.283 --> 00:08:09.329
You'll need something cute inside it.
Wieners cut like octopuses,

00:08:09.413 --> 00:08:12.082
egg roll-ups,
and so on is what I recommend.

00:08:13.542 --> 00:08:17.295
Goya champloo,
and other impractical dishes are out.

00:08:17.379 --> 00:08:21.091
Be sure to choose dishes
that'd appear in a shojo manga.

00:08:21.174 --> 00:08:23.051
Shojo manga?

00:08:23.135 --> 00:08:24.803
If you have to do prefectural dishes,

00:08:24.886 --> 00:08:27.222
pork tamago would be right on the line.

00:08:27.305 --> 00:08:29.141
Scrambled eggs and
sunny-side up eggs are out;

00:08:29.224 --> 00:08:30.851
they have to be egg roll-ups.

00:08:30.934 --> 00:08:35.105
I'm sorry, I don't understand
half the words you just said.

00:08:35.188 --> 00:08:37.149
You mean, like, shojo manga?

00:08:37.232 --> 00:08:39.651
Mm-hmm. I've never read them.

00:08:39.735 --> 00:08:43.405
Huh, well, this does not bode well.

00:08:43.488 --> 00:08:45.032
I'm sorry.

00:08:46.116 --> 00:08:47.409
It's okay.

00:08:47.492 --> 00:08:50.620
Aoi, you're coaching me on how to fight,

00:08:50.704 --> 00:08:54.082
so in return, I'll teach you how to tackle Kio.

00:08:54.166 --> 00:08:55.876
That is what we agreed to, right?

00:08:55.959 --> 00:08:57.127
Yeah, but...

00:08:57.210 --> 00:09:01.465
The problem is, he's so incredibly obtuse.

00:09:01.548 --> 00:09:04.426
We will wage a valiant attack,

00:09:04.509 --> 00:09:07.888
and yet, just getting that
dimwit to say that he loves you

00:09:07.971 --> 00:09:11.016
is going to be a real struggle, I'm sure!

00:09:11.099 --> 00:09:12.851
H-He loves me...?

00:09:12.934 --> 00:09:14.311
You have to bring a hard fastball,

00:09:14.394 --> 00:09:17.856
and I mean a real hummer to
this ballgame, or it won't work! Get it?

00:09:17.939 --> 00:09:19.357
Love is war.

00:09:19.441 --> 00:09:22.277
Keep practicing your lunch-making
until we get to the 2nd semester.

00:09:22.360 --> 00:09:24.321
You just have to work at it!

00:09:25.864 --> 00:09:27.240
Mm-hmm...

00:09:31.495 --> 00:09:33.497
Cat Planet Cuties.

00:09:41.254 --> 00:09:42.839
| wanna shoot...

00:09:45.217 --> 00:09:46.802
| wanna shoot...

00:09:50.514 --> 00:09:52.933
Ah! I wanna shoot! I wanna shoot!

00:09:53.016 --> 00:09:56.228
I've got a real gun! Why can't I practice?!

00:09:56.311 --> 00:09:57.687
Manami...

00:09:58.313 --> 00:10:02.526
I'm sorry. I did it like you told me to, but...

00:10:03.819 --> 00:10:05.529
What... is that?

00:10:05.612 --> 00:10:09.991
An egg roll-up... or at least it
was supposed to be.

00:10:11.201 --> 00:10:13.161
You need some practice, too.

00:10:13.245 --> 00:10:15.831
If it's practice you need,
| know a good place.

00:10:16.915 --> 00:10:18.333
Chayka...

00:10:18.416 --> 00:10:19.876
A good place, you say?

00:10:19.960 --> 00:10:22.420
| got a report from Eris.

00:10:22.504 --> 00:10:26.466
I'll show you where you can do
anything and no one will get mad.

00:10:28.677 --> 00:10:33.140
Listen up! A movie is time
and space captured by a camera.

00:10:33.223 --> 00:10:34.015
--Understood?

00:10:34.015 --> 00:10:34.933
--Yes, sir!
--Understood?

00:10:35.016 --> 00:10:36.059
Hey, Kio...

00:10:36.143 --> 00:10:37.018
What?

00:10:37.102 --> 00:10:41.314
| was thinking of shooting
a movie that had aliens in it.

00:10:41.398 --> 00:10:44.025
But Eris just doesn't
seem very "alieny," you know?

00:10:44.109 --> 00:10:47.988
That's right! Isn't that right?
You think so too, don't you?

00:10:49.531 --> 00:10:53.076
But earthlings don't have kitty ears or a tail.

00:10:53.160 --> 00:10:54.828
It's not that.

00:10:54.911 --> 00:10:56.830
She just doesn't seem like the real thing.

00:10:56.913 --> 00:10:57.998
Yeah.

00:10:58.081 --> 00:11:01.668
Say, Eris, can you fly a real UFO, or anything?

00:11:01.751 --> 00:11:03.378
Ah! Yeah, yeah!

00:11:03.461 --> 00:11:07.757
To be precise, a UFO is
an unidentified flying object,

00:11:07.841 --> 00:11:10.760
but if you don't mind an
identified flying object spaceship,

00:11:10.844 --> 00:11:12.554
| do have the real thing.

00:11:12.637 --> 00:11:13.471
Really?

00:11:13.555 --> 00:11:17.642
You mean, we can shoot a spaceship
scene without any trick photography?

00:11:17.726 --> 00:11:19.436
No problem.

00:11:19.519 --> 00:11:20.896
Luros...

00:11:22.981 --> 00:11:26.276
Yesh? I am overjoyed to get your page.

00:11:26.359 --> 00:11:28.445
Circle around overhead.

00:11:28.528 --> 00:11:30.947
Roger! I will fly ash ordered.

00:11:35.785 --> 00:11:37.162
A UFO!

00:11:38.205 --> 00:11:39.748
Incredible! The real thing!

00:11:39.831 --> 00:11:43.001
We can shoot a realistic sci-fi movie like this!

00:11:48.465 --> 00:11:50.800
Huh? What is this?

00:11:50.884 --> 00:11:52.302
What's wrong?

00:11:53.136 --> 00:11:54.304
This.

00:11:55.555 --> 00:11:58.391
Doesn't it look like
it's suspended by strings?

00:11:58.475 --> 00:11:59.643
It sure does.

00:11:59.726 --> 00:12:07.234
Ah, those are charge-emitting probes
used for low-speed ionocraft navigation.

00:12:07.317 --> 00:12:09.778
It just doesn't look like the real thing.

00:12:09.861 --> 00:12:10.862
You're right.

00:12:10.946 --> 00:12:14.532
Right? Isn't that right?
Spaceships aren't like this, right?

00:12:14.616 --> 00:12:17.744
Don't you have anything more,
you know, sci-fi-y?

00:12:17.827 --> 00:12:20.205
Like high-tech mechanical
robots, or anything?

00:12:20.288 --> 00:12:21.706
Yes, I do.

00:12:21.790 --> 00:12:23.625
"Yoo-hoo"

00:12:24.042 --> 00:12:25.377
Not really, huh?

00:12:25.460 --> 00:12:26.795
Nope.

00:12:26.878 --> 00:12:30.382
| know, right? That's right!
It's not like this!

00:12:30.465 --> 00:12:34.261
| guess, surprisingly enough,
the real thing doesn't look real.

00:12:34.344 --> 00:12:36.638
Movies sure are hard, huh?

00:12:36.721 --> 00:12:40.392
What's the use?
Let's come up with another plan.

00:12:40.475 --> 00:12:43.436
What do you say we quit doing sci-fi,
and make it a romantic movie?

00:12:43.520 --> 00:12:45.313
A pure-love romance, maybe?

00:12:45.397 --> 00:12:46.856
Ooh, nice!

00:12:47.649 --> 00:12:49.067
Kio...

00:12:49.150 --> 00:12:51.695
Let's have some pure-love romance!

00:12:51.778 --> 00:12:53.780
--W-Wait, Eris!
--Let's breed!

00:12:53.863 --> 00:12:56.408
What are you doing, Kakazu?!

00:12:56.491 --> 00:12:59.369
--Kio...!
--I'm not doing anything!

00:12:59.452 --> 00:13:02.330
Oh, the actors are really into it!

00:13:02.414 --> 00:13:04.624
But this isn't pure love, is it?

00:13:04.708 --> 00:13:06.501
Help me!

00:13:08.253 --> 00:13:09.504
This is...

00:13:09.587 --> 00:13:11.423
...the Virtual Room?

00:13:11.506 --> 00:13:12.465
Yes!

00:13:12.549 --> 00:13:14.801
It's what you might call a simulator.

00:13:14.884 --> 00:13:17.679
It can project any background you think of.

00:13:17.762 --> 00:13:21.474
It can reproduce just
about anything realistically.

00:13:21.558 --> 00:13:25.603
Then I can practice my
cooking without wasting any ingredients.

00:13:25.687 --> 00:13:27.814
Once we get past our 16th cycle,

00:13:27.897 --> 00:13:30.817
this place regularly helps us get through.

00:13:31.943 --> 00:13:33.737
Regularly how?

00:13:33.820 --> 00:13:36.323
That's because we
have our mating seasons.

00:13:36.406 --> 00:13:37.824
If someone doesn't have a partner,

00:13:37.907 --> 00:13:41.161
they can work through
their physiological drives in here.

00:13:42.412 --> 00:13:44.998
By working through
your physiological drives...

00:13:45.081 --> 00:13:47.292
...you don't mean...

00:13:47.375 --> 00:13:49.336
Wanna try it out?

00:13:50.920 --> 00:13:52.047
| know!

00:13:52.130 --> 00:13:54.549
| can input Kio's data
as your partner for you!

00:13:54.632 --> 00:13:57.594
The both of you like him, right?

00:13:58.887 --> 00:14:01.639
--Never mind! Just show us how to use it normally!
--Never mind! Just show us how to use it normally!

00:14:01.723 --> 00:14:04.476
There's no need to be shy, you know.

00:14:04.559 --> 00:14:06.394
It'll really satisfy you.

00:14:07.687 --> 00:14:09.272
--No, thank you!
--No, thank you!

00:14:10.982 --> 00:14:15.487
A typical Earth kitchen.
Make it come with a full set

00:14:15.570 --> 00:14:18.239
of everyday ingredients and seasonings.

00:14:24.204 --> 00:14:27.082
It's true! It's amazingly real!

00:14:27.165 --> 00:14:29.834
| know! Give me one person to act as a taster.

00:14:29.918 --> 00:14:31.378
Let's see...

00:14:31.795 --> 00:14:35.715
Um... someone a lot like Kakazu.

00:14:41.262 --> 00:14:42.389
Correction...

00:14:42.472 --> 00:14:45.141
...not "a lot like" him, give me Kakazu himself.

00:14:49.145 --> 00:14:53.024
Fantastic! I can shoot anything here?

00:14:53.108 --> 00:14:56.694
Then I want to shoot something
I'd hardly ever get a chance to!

00:14:56.778 --> 00:14:59.364
Give me an M134 minigun!

00:14:59.447 --> 00:15:03.118
Oh, it really did appear! All right...

00:15:04.994 --> 00:15:06.371
Too... heavy...

00:15:06.454 --> 00:15:09.791
This is too hard for
a girl to hoist by herself.

00:15:09.874 --> 00:15:12.627
| know! Give me Kio!

00:15:12.710 --> 00:15:14.712
Pick that up for me, will you?

00:15:14.796 --> 00:15:16.923
Oh, that's too much to ask.

00:15:17.006 --> 00:15:19.551
| can't pick up that heavy thing by myself.

00:15:19.634 --> 00:15:21.177
Whoa, he's just like him!

00:15:21.261 --> 00:15:24.139
| wonder how closely
this can reproduce things.

00:15:24.222 --> 00:15:26.474
Say, how have you been lately?

00:15:26.558 --> 00:15:30.687
How have I been? Pretty much normal.

00:15:30.770 --> 00:15:33.857
That's the reply that Kio would give.

00:15:33.940 --> 00:15:37.527
So then, what do you think of Eris?

00:15:37.610 --> 00:15:42.157
What do I think? She's all right.
Why would you ask me that?

00:15:43.450 --> 00:15:45.535
Even his back-talk is the same.

00:15:45.618 --> 00:15:49.164
Cut out the back-talk!
Make him answer me honestly!

00:15:49.247 --> 00:15:51.082
Eris...

00:15:51.166 --> 00:15:53.084
...sure has big boobs, huh?

00:15:54.419 --> 00:15:57.005
Geez, he's aggravating either way!

00:15:57.088 --> 00:15:59.591
Okay then, tell me what you think about Aoi!

00:15:59.674 --> 00:16:00.884
She's cute, you know?

00:16:00.967 --> 00:16:04.095
Ah, yes, she is that. Aoi is cute.

00:16:04.179 --> 00:16:06.139
| kind of feel sorry for her.

00:16:07.098 --> 00:16:13.062
Futaba used to always be all alone,
and seemed to avoid others.

00:16:13.146 --> 00:16:15.982
| suppose that couldn't
be helped, given her job.

00:16:16.065 --> 00:16:18.151
But she likes movies and stuff,

00:16:18.234 --> 00:16:20.653
and we seem to share the same tastes,

00:16:20.737 --> 00:16:23.907
so I thought it would be
great if we could be friends.

00:16:23.990 --> 00:16:27.660
Oh. Yeah, you're always like that.

00:16:27.744 --> 00:16:31.664
Whether it's because you're a busybody,
or just honest to a fault.

00:16:31.748 --> 00:16:33.833
So what about me, then?

00:16:33.917 --> 00:16:37.545
What do you really think about me?

00:16:37.629 --> 00:16:39.756
Manami, you're...

00:16:39.839 --> 00:16:45.720
...a violent, crass, spirited gun freak,
and an out-of-control tomboy.

00:16:45.803 --> 00:16:47.430
Well, excuse me!

00:16:47.514 --> 00:16:51.976
Still... Manami, you're the kind
of person I aspired to be.

00:16:53.436 --> 00:16:55.563
You're a lot more clear-cut than I am,

00:16:55.647 --> 00:16:58.691
you're cheerful, and good at sports.

00:16:58.775 --> 00:17:02.195
That's what I've always
liked about you, Manami.

00:17:02.278 --> 00:17:06.157
But I used to be so shy, and
couldn't talk to you that much.

00:17:06.241 --> 00:17:07.200
Kio...

00:17:07.283 --> 00:17:10.703
But then, Manami,
| happened to overhear

00:17:10.787 --> 00:17:15.875
you talking so happily on the
phone with someone named Jack.

00:17:15.959 --> 00:17:19.629
| was so sure that Jack had to be a guy...

00:17:19.712 --> 00:17:24.509
...and I thought, now Manami
has someone she's going out with.

00:17:24.592 --> 00:17:29.222
Once I did, all of a sudden,
my emotional support was taken away.

00:17:30.640 --> 00:17:31.391
--What is this?

00:17:31.391 --> 00:17:33.560
--And I didn't have to worry about a lot of things anymore.
--What is this?

00:17:33.560 --> 00:17:34.310
--What is this?

00:17:34.310 --> 00:17:37.313
--So then, I got so I could speak with you at ease, like we are now.
--What is this?

00:17:37.397 --> 00:17:38.773
What is this?

00:17:38.856 --> 00:17:43.194
Thinking back on it now,
| probably felt like I'd been dumped.

00:17:43.278 --> 00:17:45.113
What is this? What do you mean?

00:17:45.196 --> 00:17:47.448
That I had no choice but to give up.

00:17:47.532 --> 00:17:52.579
Now you tell me? So then, what?
You're saying that I caused this?

00:17:54.080 --> 00:17:57.875
That it's my fault that you act
like you're not interested in me?

00:17:57.959 --> 00:18:01.212
Because I was in contact with the CIA?

00:18:01.296 --> 00:18:02.755
Because I wasn't straightforward,

00:18:02.839 --> 00:18:05.425
and treated you like I was one of the boys?

00:18:05.508 --> 00:18:08.886
Because I didn't honestly
tell you that I liked you?

00:18:08.970 --> 00:18:12.515
Are you... Are you saying it's my fault?

00:18:12.599 --> 00:18:15.310
Mm-mm, you're not at fault, Manami.

00:18:15.393 --> 00:18:19.397
I'm the one at fault for not
telling you how I felt sooner.

00:18:19.480 --> 00:18:21.733
Not true. Not true, not true, not true!

00:18:21.816 --> 00:18:25.695
None of it is true! Don't play me
for a fool! Don't flatter yourself!

00:18:25.778 --> 00:18:29.449
Don't go thinking that all of it is your fault!

00:18:29.532 --> 00:18:31.743
Stop always pretending to be so nice!

00:18:31.826 --> 00:18:35.204
It's not like all of this is
entirely your fault, you know!

00:18:35.288 --> 00:18:38.541
I'm sorry. I'm sorry, Manami.

00:18:52.889 --> 00:18:55.099
You've got to take a breather
every once in a while.

00:18:55.183 --> 00:18:57.769
You'll suffocate if all you ever do is study.

00:18:57.852 --> 00:19:01.481
Wait up! Manami, you're going too fast.

00:19:01.564 --> 00:19:04.400
How pathetic. You're the boy here.

00:19:04.484 --> 00:19:10.114
Well... Manami, since you're
a girl, you should be more demure.

00:19:10.198 --> 00:19:12.784
What, you want a piece of me?

00:19:12.867 --> 00:19:15.119
Whoever loses has to buy the zenzai!

00:19:15.203 --> 00:19:18.414
Ah! Wait up, Manami!

00:19:18.498 --> 00:19:22.752
Heh, Kio, you've got ten years
to go before you can smart-off--

00:19:26.381 --> 00:19:31.844
Whoa... he was such a weakling,
such a crybaby, such a runt...

00:19:31.928 --> 00:19:36.182
but before I knew it,
he grew up, and overtook me...

00:19:37.475 --> 00:19:40.395
Wait! Don't leave me behind!

00:19:49.904 --> 00:19:52.073
Are you okay, Manami?

00:19:52.156 --> 00:19:53.783
Mm-hmm.

00:19:53.866 --> 00:19:56.619
You scratched your watch, huh?

00:19:56.703 --> 00:19:58.162
Mm-hmm.

00:19:58.246 --> 00:20:00.081
It's a brand-new one, right?

00:20:00.164 --> 00:20:01.416
Mm-hmm.

00:20:01.499 --> 00:20:03.084
That's too bad.

00:20:04.252 --> 00:20:05.169
Kio...

00:20:05.253 --> 00:20:06.462
What?

00:20:06.546 --> 00:20:08.297
You won't leave me behind, right?

00:20:08.381 --> 00:20:10.258
Huh? What are you talking about?

00:20:10.341 --> 00:20:13.010
Mm-mm, it's nothing.

00:20:13.094 --> 00:20:15.054
You're weird, Manami.

00:20:23.229 --> 00:20:26.232
Oh, you made this, Futaba?

00:20:26.315 --> 00:20:29.610
Mm-hmm. I wonder if
| could have you taste it.

00:20:29.694 --> 00:20:30.820
Sure.

00:20:30.903 --> 00:20:33.156
I'll be glad to eat some.

00:20:35.199 --> 00:20:37.285
How... is it?

00:20:37.368 --> 00:20:39.579
The flavor is unique...

00:20:42.957 --> 00:20:47.920
Um, in the Virtual Room,
Kakazu told me this recipe was delicious.

00:20:48.004 --> 00:20:50.798
Ah, that's because it wasn't really him.

00:20:52.008 --> 00:20:54.469
He told you it was delicious
based on how you wanted

00:20:54.552 --> 00:20:58.556
the idealized Kio
inside your mind to react.

00:20:58.639 --> 00:21:02.518
That's why the real Kio may
or may not feel the same way.

00:21:02.602 --> 00:21:03.686
Aw, man...

00:21:04.937 --> 00:21:06.606
So then,

00:21:06.689 --> 00:21:10.359
what he said before was just my...

00:21:12.487 --> 00:21:13.988
Still...

00:21:14.071 --> 00:21:16.908
Huh? Come to think of it, where is Eris?

00:21:16.991 --> 00:21:19.786
Ah, she's been called back.

00:21:20.495 --> 00:21:21.662
Aww...

00:21:22.747 --> 00:21:25.792
Do I really have to take these?

00:21:25.875 --> 00:21:28.753
In light of her worsening status
since the previous turmoil,

00:21:28.836 --> 00:21:32.632
not to mention the impediment
it has posed to her duties since,

00:21:32.715 --> 00:21:35.635
Shoreside Investigator
Eris' mating season for this year

00:21:35.718 --> 00:21:37.678
has been suspended.

00:21:37.762 --> 00:21:39.597
Captain Qoone...

00:21:39.680 --> 00:21:41.808
Well, we've got no choice.

00:21:41.891 --> 00:21:44.977
Okay, let it go. Down the hatch, now.

00:21:46.062 --> 00:21:50.274
Farewell, my first mating season.

00:21:51.734 --> 00:21:55.696
Please wait until next time, Kio!

00:22:05.957 --> 00:22:09.126
You're there smiling next to me,

00:22:09.210 --> 00:22:13.923
but it looks like that alone won't do it

00:22:14.006 --> 00:22:21.806
I wish I could touch you,
like a misty breeze

00:22:21.889 --> 00:22:29.814
My feelings can't get out
of the forest of my memories

00:22:29.897 --> 00:22:36.529
They just go to show the
never-changing distance between us

00:22:36.612 --> 00:22:45.997
Our future is held hostage by
waning and waxing irreconcilability

00:22:46.080 --> 00:22:48.708
I have to break through

00:22:48.791 --> 00:22:53.170
Every time I think of you,

00:22:53.254 --> 00:22:56.674
the memories get in the way

00:22:56.757 --> 00:23:01.178
When I want to tenderly offer
you the side of me

00:23:01.262 --> 00:23:04.557
that no one else knows

00:23:04.640 --> 00:23:20.990
I'll follow my heart, and come to see you

00:23:28.289 --> 00:23:30.207
White sands and coral reefs!

00:23:30.291 --> 00:23:33.669
Solar prints and suntans!
Micro-bikinis and thongs!

00:23:33.753 --> 00:23:36.047
Want me to guess what
yesterday's swimsuits were?

00:23:36.130 --> 00:23:38.883
Next time, "We've Come to Swim."

00:23:38.966 --> 00:23:42.345
I'm coming to drop in on you!

00:23:46.390 --> 00:23:47.433
"See you next time!"
